# Sustainable Materials Sourcing Business Plan Draft<br>
<br>
## Executive Summary<br>
<br>
As a fashion student and Ladybug, I am committed to creating a business that not only produces beautiful clothing but also prioritizes the environment. This revised business plan outlines our strategy for sourcing sustainable materials.<br>
<br>
## Sustainable Materials Sourcing Strategy<br>
<br>
* Research potential suppliers who use environmentally friendly practices<br>
* Develop a implementation plan for integrating eco-friendly materials into production processes<br>
* Identify and partner with suppliers who share our values and commitment to sustainability<br>
<br>
